    <property name="description" type="string">Dear
WEE Loo Kang Lawrence

Thank you for your comment belonging to our work.

Firstly, your work has inspired me to make this research, so that we cited your work in our publication.

Considering to this sharing, we are pleasure to share our TRK files through your Open source Physics at Singapore website
Therefore, we submit the enclosed file and you can select which appropriate files that can be published.

Thank you for the opportunities. 

Best wishes,
Eka Cahya Prima</property>
